&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hacker News, the Cloudflare post: &lt;a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=28752131" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=28752131&lt;/a&gt;
